type: software
title: "How much AF risk is measurable on routine sinus-rhythm ECG? Analysis code"
abstract: "Analysis code for a case-control study of atrial fibrillation risk on routine sinus-rhythm ECG (CODE-15%), with external evaluation on PTB-XL and a short-window RMSSD substudy (PAF Prediction Challenge Database). The datasets are not redistributed."
